{
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## S03 · Check your work\n*Guide: steps 3 to 6.*",
      "id": "class_s03_check_0"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### ⚠ Feedback from the engine\n{{fbCheck}}",
      "conditional": {
        "hide": "=fbCheck = null or fbCheck = \"\""
      },
      "id": "class_s03_check_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "separator",
      "id": "class_s03_check_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Done when\n- your latest **student-request** is deployed (wait a few seconds after the deploy)\n- it has three exclusive gateways (*Type of request?*, *Approved?* and the merge) and two default flows\n- it has two inclusive gateways and no parallel gateway\n- script tasks save `certificateNumber`, `registered`, `letter`, `studentMessage`, `instructorMessage` and `registrarMessage`\n- three completed instances, one per path: certificate; postponement approved; recognition rejected\n- the engine saw the condition incident of step 6, and no instance is still stopped at it",
      "id": "class_s03_check_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Complete this task to run the check.",
      "id": "class_s03_check_4"
    }
  ],
  "type": "default",
  "id": "class-s03-check",
  "executionPlatform": "Camunda Cloud",
  "executionPlatformVersion": "8.9.0",
  "schemaVersion": 18
}
